  "description": "The camera stress run (design bible §2; cam_* targets): from Level 1's spawn, facing east, back into the start room's west wall (the arm squeezed against the player's back), walk east into Corridor A and lock on to the central room's levy as it comes, fight it beside Corridor A's north pillar (a light swing that falls short and one that lands, a dodge left that pins the camera against the pillar, three more hits to the kill), then, once its body is gone, turn about in the 4 m corridor: 90° right, walk, 90° left. Every other enemy is removed so only the camera varies. Movement is camera-relative, so a different camera can change the path; the inputs stay fixed.",
